  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">enum class FutureStatus :              <a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/integer\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::uint8_t</a> {...};</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Specifies the status of a <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_core_Future_420ba8.html\">ara::core::Future</a> as returned by: • Future&lt;T,E&gt;::wait_for() • Future&lt;void,E&gt;::wait_for() • Future&lt;T,E&gt;::wait_until() • Future&lt;void,E&gt;::wait_until() These definitions are equivalent to the ones from std::future_status. However, no item equivalent to std::future_status::deferred is available here. Implementation            The numerical values of the enum literals are implementation-defined</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n\n"
